Version 1.02 (October 1, 2026)
------------------------------
* Converted to native nftables for Arno's (NFT) Firewall (rules in table inet anf)
* Rules are no longer removed when stopping, (re)start and stop replace the whole ruleset atomically
! PARASITIC_NET_DENY_POLICY (DROP/REJECT) was used as a chain name instead of as a verdict
! Duplicate rules for interfaces with multiple addresses in one subnet, the client networks are
  now taken from the connected routes
* The helper rebuilds PARASITIC_NET_ACL in one atomic update
* Status output adapted to nft listings

Version 1.01 (January 14, 2019)
-------------------------------
+ Support for specifying source hosts in PARASITIC_NET_HOST_xxxxxxxxxxxxx variables

Version 1.00 (May 9, 2019)
--------------------------
! Fixed (dynamic) host multi IP handling
! Fixed misplaced RETVAL=1 statement

Version 1.00-RC1 (February 12, 2019)
------------------------------------
* Sync code with dyndns-host-open & traffic-accounting plugins

Version 1.00-BETA3 (June 11, 2018)
----------------------------------
* Added new dynamic host support (requires AIF 2.1.0+)

Version 1.00-BETA2 (April 5, 2018)
----------------------------------
+ Allow specifying multiple interfaces
+ Allow specifying IP for interfaces to use (aliased) interfaces with multiple IPs
+ Allow specifying subnet for PARASITIC_NET_CLIENTS_HOSTS or leaving it empty
+ Instead of only allowing certain hosts, also allow specifying which TCP/UDP/ICMP/IP protos to allow/deny
+ Add setting to select deny-policy (DROP or REJECT)
* Misc. tweaks/refactor

Version 1.00-BETA1 (July 25, 2017)
----------------------------------
+ Initial version
